css34: no gamedata auto-updater (updater.ext, webternet.ext)

updater.ext posts the md5 of every file under gamedata/ to
update.sourcemod.net (plain HTTP through webternet.ext's bundled libcurl
7.19.2, built without TLS) and writes the files the server sends back over
them. Upstream gamedata has no CS:S v34 entries, so an update would undo the
css34 gamedata. Packages turned it off with "DisableAutoUpdate" "yes"; now it
is not built at all. webternet.ext has no natives and no other user, so it
goes with it.

- AMBuildScript: extensions/curl and extensions/updater are not built.
- core: StartSourceMod no longer loads updater.ext, whatever core.cfg says
  (a leftover updater.ext from an older install stays unloaded).
- configs/core.cfg: DisableAutoUpdate, ForceRestartAfterUpdate, AutoUpdateURL
  and DebugSpew (it only described updater logging) are gone; an old core.cfg
  that still has them loads unchanged.

